# ADR-0026 Decision 4: a scripted mana ability (Llanowar Elves' AB$ Mana,
# CR 605.1a) is a priority answer too. human taps the Elves and a Forest
# for G each and casts Grizzly Bears ({1}{G}); both pass and it resolves.
startturn human
# Upkeep first: a queued action is spent on the first priority round that
# asks its player, so queue only once Main1 is next (turn 1 skips the draw
# step, CR 103.7a).
step
queue paygeneric G
queue action human manaability 2 0
queue action human tapformana 3 G
queue action human cast 1
step
